	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Genome wide CRISPR screen for Venetoclax resisatnce in MOLM13 cells using Brunello library</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">MOLM13 cells were infected with CRISPR/Cas9 library, selected for puromycn resistance for integration events and exposed to Venetoclax or vehicle, DMSO, at 1microMolar concentrations. Cells were collected at time 0 (post puromycin selection), day 7 and 14 , DNA was extracted and sgRNA barcodes were amplified. PCR library was deep sequenced using highthroughput Illumina platform Hiseq using 6 samples per lane.</Item>
